course: dictionary
lesson: 10008
title: Temp: one word, several meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one to use. «What's the temp outside?» is about temperature, how hot or cold the air is. A temp at work is a worker who is there for a short time, often sent by an agency.
explain: Look at the clues around the word. If the sentence is about weather or machines, temp means temperature. If it is about jobs, temp means a short-term worker. If it is about files or jobs that last only a while, temp means temporary.
explain: Look at this code: «if temp > 25 Hot, else if temp > 15 Warm, else Cold». Here temp is a number for temperature. With temp = 20, the answer is Warm, because 20 is not above 25 but is above 15, and only the first true branch runs.
fact: Temp is short for temperature: «What's the temp outside?» asks what the temperature is.
fact: A temp is an informal word for a worker who works for a company only for a short time, often through an agency.
fact: To temp means to work as a temp.
fact: Temp is also short for temporary, as in a temp job or a temp file, which lasts only for a while.
exercise: «What's the temp outside?» What does temp mean here? | A worker who comes in for a short time | A temporary file on a computer | A short walk | *Temperature, how hot or cold it is
exercise: Mia's agency sends her to work at a school for three weeks while Mrs Brown is away. What is Mia? | A temperature gauge | *A temp, a worker there for a short time | A weather forecaster | A teacher who will stay for years
exercise: In «if temp > 25 Hot, else if temp > 15 Warm, else Cold», what does the code say when temp = 10? | Warm | Hot | *Cold | Temp
test: In «a temp file», what does temp mean? | A worker who comes in for a short time | Temperature | *Temporary, lasting only for a while | Temple
test: Which sentence uses temp to mean a short-term worker? | Sam checked the temp of the soup. | Sam is a teacher for life. | *Sam became a temp at the bank for one month. | The temp outside is 12 degrees.
exam: In «What's the temp outside?», temp is short for what? | Temple | Tempo | *Temperature | Temporary
